{
    "name": "omnibox",
    "display_name": "Omnibox",
    "description": "OmniBox 是以「聚合」为核心的家庭影视系统，一站式整合采集站影视、网盘资源（阿里云盘、夸克、115 等）、IPTV 电视源与 B 站、抖音等平台直播源，支持弹幕、TMDB 刮削、TVBox 对接与多用户管理，网页、手机、电视多端可用。",
    "category": "movie",
    "tags": ["影视", "聚合", "网盘", "直播", "在线播放"],
    "website": "https://hub.docker.com/r/lampon/omnibox",
    "source_url": "https://hub.docker.com/r/lampon/omnibox",
    "architectures": ["amd64", "arm64"],
    "image": "lampon/omnibox",
    "default_ports": [
        {"port": 7023, "protocol": "tcp", "description": "Web 访问端口"}
    ],
    "config_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["ports", "volumes"],
        "containers": [
            {
                "name": "omnibox",
                "title": "Omnibox",
                "settings": [
                    {"type": "ports", "title": "端口设置", "fields": ["ports"]},
                    {"type": "volumes", "title": "存储空间设置", "fields": ["volumes"]},
                    {"type": "env", "title": "环境变量", "fields": ["omnibox_env"]},
                    {"type": "advanced", "title": "高级设置", "fields": ["privileged"]}
                ],
                "description": "OmniBox 影视直播聚合平台"
            }
        ],
        "properties": {
            "ports": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["local_port", "container_port", "protocol"],
                    "properties": {
                        "protocol": {"enum": ["tcp", "udp"], "type": "string", "title": "协议", "default": "tcp"},
                        "local_port": {"type": "integer", "title": "本地端口", "maximum": 65535, "minimum": 1},
                        "container_port": {"type": "integer", "title": "容器端口", "maximum": 65535, "minimum": 1}
                    }
                },
                "title": "端口设置",
                "default": [
                    {"protocol": "tcp", "local_port": 7023, "container_port": 7023}
                ]
            },
            "volumes": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["host_path", "container_path", "mode"],
                    "properties": {
                        "mode": {"enum": ["rw", "ro"], "type": "string", "title": "权限", "default": "rw"},
                        "host_path": {"type": "string", "title": "本地路径", "format": "directory"},
                        "container_path": {"type": "string", "title": "容器路径"}
                    }
                },
                "title": "存储空间设置",
                "default": [
                    {"mode": "rw", "host_path": "omnibox/data", "container_path": "/app/data"}
                ]
            },
            "omnibox_env": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["key", "value"],
                    "properties": {
                        "key": {"type": "string", "title": "变量名"},
                        "value": {"type": "string", "title": "值"}
                    }
                },
                "title": "环境变量",
                "default": [
                    {"key": "TZ", "value": "Asia/Shanghai"},
                    {"key": "DATABASE_TYPE", "value": "sqlite"}
                ]
            },
            "privileged": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "title": "特权模式",
                "default": false,
                "description": "一般无需开启"
            }
        }
    },
    "yaml_template": "services:\n  omnibox:\n    image: {{ image }}\n    container_name: {{ project_name }}\n    ports:\n{%- for port in ports %}\n      - \"{{ port.local_port }}:{{ port.container_port }}/{{ port.protocol }}\"\n{%- endfor %}\n    volumes:\n{%- for vol in volumes %}\n      - {{ to_host_path(vol.host_path if (vol.host_path.startswith('/') or vol.shared) else project_name ~ '/' ~ vol.host_path) }}:{{ vol.container_path }}:{{ vol.mode }}\n{%- endfor %}\n    privileged: {{ privileged | lower }}\n    restart: unless-stopped\n{%- if omnibox_env %}\n    environment:\n{%- for item in omnibox_env %}\n      - {{ item.key }}={{ item.value }}\n{%- endfor %}\n{%- endif %}\n",
    "readme": "# Omnibox\n\nOmniBox 是以「聚合」为核心的家庭影视系统，一站式整合在线影视、网盘资源与电视直播：\n\n- 多源影视聚合：支持采集站与阿里云盘、夸克、115 等主流网盘资源，无需下载即可在线播放\n- 电视直播：支持 IPTV 电视源及 B 站、抖音等平台直播源\n- 支持弹幕 API、TMDB API 接入，可展示分季分集海报、简介、演员与评分\n- 支持密码保护、多用户管理，可对接 TVBox 等第三方播放端\n\n## 部署前准备\n\n1. 默认端口 `7023`，如有冲突请修改本地端口。\n2. 数据目录 `/app/data` 已默认持久化；默认使用 SQLite 数据库（`DATABASE_TYPE=sqlite`），无需额外配置，也可改用 MySQL / PostgreSQL。\n\n## 使用\n\n1. 部署完成后访问 `http://<NAS-IP>:7023`，首次使用建议先设置访问密码。\n2. 进入「爬虫管理」添加影视源、直播源等接口后首页才有内容；可配合 PanSou 网盘搜索获得更佳体验。",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "type": "compose",
    "changelog": "初始导入",
    "backup_paths": ["/app/data"],
    "is_builtin": false
}
